WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.840
Write the lesson in one sentence, list

00:00:01.840 --> 00:00:03.800
the shots you need, charge two camera

00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:05.980
batteries, do not format the backup card,

00:00:06.240 --> 00:00:08.100
record a short sound check, leave room

00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:10.340
for another day, label every source folder,

00:00:10.620 --> 00:00:11.760
backup the entire session.